# Git

After finishing a change, commit and push to `origin` without waiting to be asked.

- Follow this repo's commit style: one short sentence on why, not a file list.
- When HUD web assets change, bump `HUD_PAGE_ASSET_REV` in `lsl/Canasta_HUD.lsl` in the same commit.
- Do not skip hooks. Do not force-push `main`.
